# CI-only tools, by name. requirements-ci-lock.txt at the repository root holds
# their exact versions and hashes; see its header for the compile command.
#
# This file lives in ci/ rather than beside the locks on purpose: a .in file in
# the repository root makes Dependabot treat requirements-lock.txt as a
# pip-compile output it cannot regenerate, so it stops updating that lock and
# opens partial pull requests that fail the lock-agreement tests.
pytest-cov
pytest-playwright
playwright
build
pip-audit
